- %%% Untyped variables:
- 
- % @defvr category var args
- \makedefun{defvr}#1 {\deftypevrheader{#1} {} }
- 
- % @defcv category class var args
- \makedefun{defcv}#1 {\defcvof{#1\ \putwordof}}
