- % \rawbackslash defines an active \ to do \backslashcurfont.
- % \otherbackslash defines an active \ to be a literal `\' character with
- % catcode other.
- {\catcode`\\=\active
-  @gdef@rawbackslash{@let\=@backslashcurfont}
-  @gdef@otherbackslash{@let\=@realbackslash}
